  },
  {
   "start": 7.244,
   "end": 13.856,
   "text": "Again, मैंने बोला था salary late आएगी, आप लोग daily call करके irritate कर रहे हो।",
   "speaker_id": "ch1",
   "language": "hi-IN",
   "role": "borrower"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.42,
   "end": 20.48,
   "text": "Sorry for the inconvenience पूजा जी, मैं बस reminder दे रही हूँ, due date 5 दिन पहले निकल गई है।",
   "speaker_id": "ch0",
   "language": "hi-IN",
   "role": "agent"
  },
  {
   "start": 19.916,
   "end": 24.128,
   "text": "तो मैं क्या करूँ? कंपनी ने ही salary hold की है।",
   "speaker_id": "ch1",
   "language": "hi-IN",
   "role": "borrower"
  },
  {
   "start": 23.596,
   "end": 30.624,
   "text": "Totally समझ सकती हूँ, बस inform कर दूँ, agreement के हिसाब से late payment charges apply होंगे।",
   "speaker_id": "ch0",
   "language": "hi-IN",
   "role": "agent"
  },
  {
   "start": 30.06,
   "end": 32.864,
   "text": "और अगर next week भी नहीं हुआ तो?",
   "speaker_id": "ch1",
   "language": "hi-IN",
   "role": "borrower"
  },
  {
   "start": 32.332,
   "end": 40.544,
   "text": "तो as per loan agreement account credit bureau को overdue report हो सकता है जिससे आपका credit score affect होगा।",
   "speaker_id": "ch0",
   "language": "en-IN",
